('L2024-000005036', 'P2425-0000042', 'Product has been Deleted ', 'Products', 'Delete', 'a:1:{i:0;a:33:{s:9:\"ProductID\";s:13:\"P2425-0000042\";s:4:\"Slug\";s:19:\"myk-epoxy-black-1kg\";s:11:\"ProductName\";s:21:\"Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg\";s:11:\"ProductType\";s:6:\"Simple\";s:6:\"Stages\";s:32:\"a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}\";s:15:\"RelatedProducts\";a:0:{}s:6:\"MinQty\";i:0;s:6:\"MaxQty\";i:0;s:6:\"HSNSAC\";s:4:\"3214\";s:11:\"ProductCode\";N;s:8:\"VideoURL\";N;s:3:\"CID\";s:14:\"PC2024-0000008\";s:6:\"PCName\";s:23:\"Construction  Chemicals\";s:4:\"SCID\";s:15:\"PSC2425-0000019\";s:7:\"PSCName\";s:13:\"MYK Adhesives\";s:3:\"UID\";s:15:\"UOM2023-0000004\";s:5:\"UName\";s:2:\"KG\";s:5:\"UCode\";s:2:\"KG\";s:7:\"TaxType\";s:7:\"Include\";s:5:\"TaxID\";s:14:\"TX2023-0000002\";s:5:\"PRate\";i:550;s:5:\"SRate\";i:500;s:8:\"Decimals\";s:4:\"auto\";s:11:\"Description\";s:2812:\"<p><strong>Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg</strong> is a high-performance, industrial-grade epoxy resin designed for a variety of construction and repair applications. Here&#39;s a brief description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy - Black is a durable, two-component epoxy system available in a 1kg pack. It is formulated to provide excellent bonding, sealing, and protective properties, with a deep black color that adds an aesthetic appeal.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Strong Adhesion:</strong> Offers superior bonding strength to a wide range of surfaces, including concrete, metal, and wood.</li>\n	<li><strong>High Durability:</strong> Resistant to wear, chemicals, and environmental factors, ensuring long-lasting performance.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Provides a sleek, black finish that is both functional and visually appealing.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Applications:</strong> Suitable for use in flooring, crack repairs, protective coatings, and other construction tasks.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy to Use:</strong> The two components are easy to mix and apply, with a manageable curing time.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Flooring:</strong> Ideal for creating durable, attractive epoxy floors in industrial, commercial, and residential spaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Repairs:</strong> Used for filling and repairing cracks, gaps, and defects in concrete surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Coatings:</strong> Provides a protective, aesthetically pleasing coating for metal and other surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Bonding:</strong> Excellent for joining different materials where strong adhesion is required.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the two components of the epoxy in the recommended ratio until a uniform black color is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply to clean, dry surfaces using a trowel, brush, or roller, depending on the specific application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow sufficient curing time as specified in the product instructions to achieve optimal hardness and durability.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and moisture.</li>\n	<li>Keep containers tightly sealed when not in use.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Follow safety guidelines, including using gloves and protective eyewear.</li>\n	<li>Ensure adequate ventilation during application.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg is an ideal solution for construction professionals and DIY enthusiasts looking for a reliable, aesthetically pleasing epoxy system for various applications.<button id=\"radix-:rlb:\"></button></p>\";s:16:\"ShortDescription\";s:3891:\"<p><strong>Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg</strong> is a high-performance, two-component epoxy system designed for a wide range of construction and industrial applications. This product is ideal for tasks requiring strong adhesion, durability, and a sleek black finish. Here&rsquo;s a full description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg is a professional-grade epoxy resin and hardener system, formulated to provide exceptional bonding, chemical resistance, and long-lasting durability. The black color adds a modern, sophisticated appearance, making it suitable for both functional and aesthetic applications.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Strong Adhesion:</strong> Offers superior bonding to various substrates, including concrete, metal, wood, and plastics.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Durability:</strong> Provides excellent resistance to wear, impact, and abrasion, ensuring long-term performance even in harsh environments.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Chemical Resistance:</strong> Withstands exposure to chemicals, oils, and solvents, making it ideal for industrial settings.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> The black epoxy cures to a smooth, glossy finish that enhances the appearance of surfaces while providing protection.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Versatile Applications:</strong> Suitable for use in flooring, coatings, repairs, and bonding applications across various industries.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Waterproofing:</strong> Forms a waterproof barrier, protecting surfaces from moisture ingress and corrosion.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Easy to Mix and Apply:</strong> The two-component system is easy to mix and apply, ensuring consistent results with minimal effort.</p>\n	</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Floor Coatings:</strong> Ideal for creating durable, chemical-resistant floors in garages, workshops, and industrial areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Surface Repairs:</strong> Perfect for repairing cracks, gaps, and surface defects in concrete, metal, and wood.</li>\n	<li><strong>Adhesive Bonding:</strong> Provides strong, reliable bonding for various materials in construction and manufacturing.</li>\n	<li><strong>Protective Coatings:</strong> Suitable for protective coatings on machinery, tools, and other equipment exposed to harsh conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Mixing and Application Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the epoxy resin and hardener in the specified ratio (typically 1:1 by volume), ensuring a thorough mix until a uniform black color is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Surface Preparation:</strong> Clean and dry the surface to remove any dirt, grease, or loose particles before application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply the mixed epoxy using a brush, roller, or trowel, depending on the application. Ensure even coverage for the best results.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the epoxy to cure for the recommended time. Full curing typically occurs within 24 hours, depending on the temperature and humidity.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and moisture.</li>\n	<li>Keep the containers tightly sealed when not in use to prevent contamination and ensure product longevity.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Follow all safety guidelines when handling and applying Myk Epoxy.</li>\n	<li>Wear appropriate personal protective equipment (PPE), including gloves, masks, and eye protection, to avoid skin contact and inhalation of fumes.</li>\n	<li>Ensure adequate ventilation in the workspace during application and curing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>For specific technical details, always refer to the manufacturer&rsquo;s technical datasheet and product label.</p>\";s:10:\"Attributes\";a:0:{}s:12:\"ProductImage\";s:28:\"assets/images/no-image-b.png\";s:15:\"ProductBrochure\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"Images\";a:0:{}s:12:\"ActiveStatus\";s:6:\"Active\";s:5:\"DFlag\";i:0;s:9:\"variation\";a:0:{}s:7:\"gallery\";a:0:{}}}', 'a:0