nce.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Provides a smooth, even surface once cured, which can be sanded and painted if required.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Surface Repairs:</strong> Ideal for repairing cracks, holes, and other imperfections in concrete, metal, and wood surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Filling Gaps:</strong> Effective for filling gaps and voids in a variety of construction materials.</li>\n	<li><strong>Maintenance:</strong> Useful for maintaining and restoring surfaces in both industrial and residential settings.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the two components of the epoxy filler according to the manufacturer&#39;s instructions. Ensure thorough mixing until a uniform consistency is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply the mixed filler to the prepared surface using a suitable tool, such as a trowel or putty knife. Smooth out the surface to achieve the desired finish.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the filler to cure fully as per the product instructions to ensure optimal strength and adhesion. Curing times may vary based on environmental conditions.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and moisture.</li>\n	<li>Keep containers tightly sealed when not in use to prevent contamination and drying.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Follow standard safety precautions during handling and application, including wearing gloves and protective eyewear.</li>\n	<li>Ensure adequate ventilation in the application area.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum provides a reliable and effective solution for various repair and maintenance tasks, delivering both strength and a polished appearance to finished surfaces.</p>\n\n<p><button></button><button><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff; c